    "text": "s dashboards for inventory value, stock metrics, low-stock alerts, and operational reporting.\nYouTube Transcript Extractor + AI Summarizer | React, Node.js, Express, HuggingFace API (2025)\n• Built a transcript retrieval and AI summarization platform with translation support and chunked text processing.\n• Designed REST endpoints for transcript extraction and summarization while handling large-text workflows and API limits.\n• Improved backend reliability using asynchronous pipelines and robust fallback logic.\nFlixTerra – Movie Streaming Web App | React, TailwindCSS, Node.js, Express (2025)\n• Developed a full-stack movie platform with search, filtering, dynamic routing, and detailed movie pages.\n• Implemented HTTP range-based video streaming for smooth playback and seeking.\n• Added favorites management and reusable component architecture.\nEXPERIENCE\nWinter Internship\n• Refactored backend email workflows by replacing SendGrid with Nodemailer across OTP, password reset, and notification\nsys",
